1
00:01:26,385 --> 00:01:31,025
The Scholar and the Emperor

2
00:01:41,825 --> 00:01:42,705
Shopkeeper.

3
00:01:44,625 --> 00:01:46,625
I wonder how Proprietor Yan is doing.

4
00:01:47,185 --> 00:01:48,145
Shopkeeper,

5
00:01:48,225 --> 00:01:50,665
you may compete fiercely in business
with Proprietor Yan,

6
00:01:50,745 --> 00:01:52,025
but you really do care about her.

7
00:01:53,225 --> 00:01:54,145
Business is business.

8
00:01:54,225 --> 00:01:56,905
But you saw how terrifying
people on the Infinity Pill can become.

9
00:01:56,985 --> 00:01:58,945
Master Zhao and Old Madam Zhao

10
00:01:59,025 --> 00:02:00,465
are both gone now.

11
00:02:03,065 --> 00:02:04,625
For a woman like Proprietor Yan,

12
00:02:04,705 --> 00:02:06,065
making her way in the world alone
is not easy.

13
00:02:06,905 --> 00:02:07,865
Fortunately, Lord Meng was there this time

14
00:02:07,945 --> 00:02:09,065
and managed to save her.

15
00:02:24,225 --> 00:02:25,345
My lord.

16
00:02:25,905 --> 00:02:26,905
Heaven has shown mercy.

17
00:02:27,825 --> 00:02:28,825
The poison in Miss Yan's body

18
00:02:28,905 --> 00:02:29,905
is gradually dissipating.

19
00:02:29,985 --> 00:02:32,665
With proper recuperation,
she will be fine.

20
00:02:42,905 --> 00:02:44,105
Thank goodness you're all right.

21
00:02:45,865 --> 00:02:47,185
Thank goodness you're back.

22
00:03:01,025 --> 00:03:02,225
Mengmeng.

23
00:03:02,865 --> 00:03:03,705
Fuzhi.

24
00:03:07,505 --> 00:03:09,745
Did I hurt you?

25
00:03:15,945 --> 00:03:17,385
This is all my fault.

26
00:03:20,345 --> 00:03:22,585
I dragged you into all this trouble.

27
00:03:26,865 --> 00:03:27,745
I'm sorry.

28
00:03:40,905 --> 00:03:42,265
I'm sorry, Fuzhi.

29
00:03:51,625 --> 00:03:52,465
Don't cry.

30
00:04:40,425 --> 00:04:42,065
Thank you for coming so late,
Your Majesty.

31
00:04:47,225 --> 00:04:48,625
Fuzhi is out of danger.

32
00:05:03,665 --> 00:05:04,905
Since she's fine,

33
00:05:06,745 --> 00:05:08,145
why are you still crying?

34
00:05:08,865 --> 00:05:09,705
I'm afraid.

35
00:05:12,665 --> 00:05:14,585
Afraid this is all another dream.

36
00:05:15,785 --> 00:05:17,825
Afraid something worse
will happen again.

37
00:05:19,105 --> 00:05:20,745
I'm afraid that even if I give everything,

38
00:05:21,305 --> 00:05:23,345
I still can't protect those I love.

39
00:05:32,545 --> 00:05:33,825
These past days,

40
00:05:34,385 --> 00:05:36,705
watching you and Miss Yan
face life and death together,

41
00:05:38,385 --> 00:05:39,865
I finally understood.

42
00:05:41,065 --> 00:05:42,705
Without the lights of countless homes

43
00:05:42,785 --> 00:05:44,025
in these ordinary streets,

44
00:05:44,625 --> 00:05:45,785
a realm stretching thousands of miles

45
00:05:46,345 --> 00:05:48,985
is nothing but cold lines on a map.

46
00:05:50,425 --> 00:05:51,665
But I'm afraid

47
00:05:54,385 --> 00:05:57,145
I can't even protect
this one small light before me.

48
00:05:57,785 --> 00:05:59,905
The light you would die to protect

49
00:06:01,265 --> 00:06:03,105
is the realm I must protect.

50
00:06:03,945 --> 00:06:05,025
You protect it.

51
00:06:06,065 --> 00:06:07,105
I will protect you,

52
00:06:14,345 --> 00:06:16,145
and all the people of this realm.

53
00:06:29,945 --> 00:06:32,265
-Come out, Meng Tinghui!
-Come out, Meng Tinghui!

54
00:06:32,345 --> 00:06:34,065
-Come out here!
-Come out here!

55
00:06:34,145 --> 00:06:35,305
Stop hiding like a coward!

56
00:06:35,385 --> 00:06:36,305
Come out!

57
00:06:36,385 --> 00:06:37,545
Stop hiding like a coward!

58
00:06:38,545 --> 00:06:39,985
Meng Tinghui!

59
00:06:42,745 --> 00:06:43,905
Meng Tinghui!

60
00:06:47,665 --> 00:06:48,985
Don't move. Back away!

61
00:06:51,305 --> 00:06:52,425
Meng Tinghui!

62
00:06:53,305 --> 00:06:54,265
Calm down.

63
00:06:54,865 --> 00:06:56,745
My father and grandmother
aren't even buried yet,

64
00:06:56,825 --> 00:06:58,945
and you dare hide in there?

65
00:06:59,025 --> 00:07:00,905
A birthday feast has become a funeral.

66
00:07:00,985 --> 00:07:02,345
They died with grievances unresolved.

67
00:07:03,145 --> 00:07:04,625
If I can't give them justice,

68
00:07:04,705 --> 00:07:05,945
how can I lay them to rest?

69
00:07:10,465 --> 00:07:13,105
How could you let Ling Yunfei escape?

70
00:07:13,945 --> 00:07:16,065
Today, it was my Zhao family.

71
00:07:16,585 --> 00:07:17,505
What about tomorrow?

72
00:07:17,585 --> 00:07:19,105
Are we supposed to live

73
00:07:19,185 --> 00:07:22,345
in fear and misery every day?

74
00:07:22,425 --> 00:07:25,545
-Exactly!
-My son!

75
00:07:25,625 --> 00:07:28,345
You said you'd marry
once you'd saved enough.

76
00:07:28,425 --> 00:07:30,225
Now I, an old mother,

77
00:07:30,305 --> 00:07:31,705
must bury my own son.

78
00:07:31,785 --> 00:07:34,345
How am I supposed to go on?

79
00:07:37,225 --> 00:07:39,865
You beasts living off the court!

80
00:07:39,945 --> 00:07:42,065
You don't care
if commoners live or die!

81
00:07:42,145 --> 00:07:45,185
-Stone them!
-Stone them!

82
00:07:47,585 --> 00:07:49,945
-Stone them!
-Back away!

83
00:07:51,185 --> 00:07:52,145
And you still have the nerve to stop us!

84
00:08:01,465 --> 00:08:02,785
Yinqing.

85
00:08:03,385 --> 00:08:04,385
I'm fine, my lord.

86
00:08:06,665 --> 00:08:07,625
Everyone,

87
00:08:07,705 --> 00:08:08,865
everyone,

88
00:08:09,705 --> 00:08:11,385
I understand your pain and fear.

89
00:08:13,145 --> 00:08:14,225
I, Meng Tinghui,

90
00:08:14,745 --> 00:08:16,505
make this solemn pledge today:

91
00:08:17,065 --> 00:08:18,585
within ten days,

92
00:08:18,665 --> 00:08:19,945
I will eradicate the Infinity Pill,

93
00:08:20,025 --> 00:08:21,065
capture Ling Yunfei,

94
00:08:21,625 --> 00:08:22,905
and restore peace to the people.

95
00:08:23,705 --> 00:08:25,585
Ten days? Can she do it?

96
00:08:25,665 --> 00:08:26,505
Is she serious?

97
00:08:26,585 --> 00:08:28,425
My lord, please reconsider.

98
00:08:28,505 --> 00:08:29,785
Ten days is too short.

99
00:08:29,865 --> 00:08:31,505
A military pledge is no joke.

100
00:08:31,585 --> 00:08:32,585
You can't make one lightly.

101
00:08:32,665 --> 00:08:34,305
My mind is made up.

102
00:08:34,385 --> 00:08:35,385
I mean every word.

103
00:08:36,505 --> 00:08:38,385
Everyone here may bear witness.

104
00:08:39,425 --> 00:08:40,705
I give myself ten days.

105
00:08:40,785 --> 00:08:42,265
If I fail,

106
00:08:43,345 --> 00:08:44,785
I will surrender my office
and become a commoner,

107
00:08:45,345 --> 00:08:46,585
and accept punishment under the law

108
00:08:47,345 --> 00:08:48,545
without complaint.

109
00:08:54,985 --> 00:08:56,105
Your Majesty,

110
00:08:56,185 --> 00:08:57,785
the Tiger's Roar Gang leader escaped,

111
00:08:57,865 --> 00:08:59,705
and the Infinity Pill is still missing.

112
00:08:59,785 --> 00:09:01,305
If he is allowed to return,

113
00:09:01,385 --> 00:09:03,265
the capital will suffer greatly.

114
00:09:03,345 --> 00:09:04,825
I impeach her today

115
00:09:04,905 --> 00:09:06,585
because public anger is boiling over.

116
00:09:06,665 --> 00:09:07,545
If it is not calmed,

117
00:09:07,625 --> 00:09:08,745
chaos may erupt.

118
00:09:09,425 --> 00:09:11,105
I implore Your Majesty

119
00:09:11,185 --> 00:09:12,945
to strip her of office and punish her,

120
00:09:13,425 --> 00:09:14,865
to reassure the people.

121
00:09:16,505 --> 00:09:17,465
Your Majesty,

122
00:09:17,545 --> 00:09:19,945
the Left Chancellor and I often disagree,

123
00:09:21,825 --> 00:09:23,065
but this time

124
00:09:23,145 --> 00:09:24,705
his words are sound.

125
00:09:24,785 --> 00:09:26,425
Ling Yunfei has thrown
the capital into chaos

126
00:09:26,505 --> 00:09:27,985
all because of Meng Tinghui.

127
00:09:28,065 --> 00:09:29,745
Suspend her from office.

128
00:09:29,825 --> 00:09:31,145
It will calm the people,

129
00:09:31,225 --> 00:09:33,705
and force Ling Yunfei
to stay his hand for now.

130
00:09:37,745 --> 00:09:38,625
Absurd!

131
00:09:38,705 --> 00:09:40,305
The Tiger's Roar Gang caused this,

132
00:09:40,865 --> 00:09:41,785
yet you want to punish

133
00:09:41,865 --> 00:09:43,505
the head of the Office of Public Inquiry?

134
00:09:43,585 --> 00:09:44,785
A mere bandit chief

135
00:09:44,865 --> 00:09:45,905
and a single poison pill

136
00:09:45,985 --> 00:09:48,225
have thrown my entire court into chaos.

137
00:09:48,305 --> 00:09:50,545
If an enemy invades one day,

138
00:09:51,225 --> 00:09:53,705
will you all rush
to submit surrender petitions?

139
00:09:55,185 --> 00:09:56,065
Your Majesty.

140
00:09:56,665 --> 00:09:58,065
Your Majesty.

141
00:09:58,145 --> 00:09:59,065
I, Meng Tinghui,

142
00:09:59,945 --> 00:10:00,945
willingly accept punishment.

143
00:10:04,265 --> 00:10:05,345
The Infinity Pill case

144
00:10:05,945 --> 00:10:07,385
is the Tiger's Roar Gang's crime,

145
00:10:07,465 --> 00:10:08,865
but the Office of Public Inquiry
bears responsibility,

146
00:10:08,945 --> 00:10:10,025
and I bear the greatest responsibility.

147
00:10:11,345 --> 00:10:13,185
I have made a military pledge
to the people.

148
00:10:13,825 --> 00:10:14,865
Within ten days,

149
00:10:15,465 --> 00:10:17,145
if I fail to eradicate the Infinity Pill

150
00:10:17,225 --> 00:10:18,585
and capture Ling Yunfei,

151
00:10:19,105 --> 00:10:20,625
I will accept any punishment.

152
00:10:28,825 --> 00:10:29,825
Meng Tinghui,

153
00:10:30,385 --> 00:10:32,065
given your determination
to catch the culprit,

154
00:10:32,145 --> 00:10:33,905
I grant you ten days.

155
00:10:33,985 --> 00:10:36,065
Your Majesty, Meng Tinghui's pledge

156
00:10:36,585 --> 00:10:37,745
merely fulfills her duty.

157
00:10:38,545 --> 00:10:40,345
The present situation

158
00:10:40,425 --> 00:10:42,065
was caused by her dereliction.

159
00:10:42,145 --> 00:10:43,425
Under the Laws of Daning,

160
00:10:43,505 --> 00:10:45,065
she should receive twenty strokes

161
00:10:45,145 --> 00:10:46,185
as a warning to others.

162
00:10:46,265 --> 00:10:47,425
Enough.

163
00:10:49,465 --> 00:10:52,065
Meng Tinghui has made her pledge.

164
00:10:53,145 --> 00:10:54,305
As court officials,

165
00:10:54,865 --> 00:10:57,065
instead of working together
to suppress the bandits,

166
00:10:57,145 --> 00:10:59,705
you attack a colleague
over street gossip.

167
00:10:59,785 --> 00:11:02,305
I think you deserve
twenty strokes yourselves.

168
00:11:02,385 --> 00:11:03,425
Your Majesty.

169
00:11:04,305 --> 00:11:06,465
I saw the people's suffering
with my own eyes.

170
00:11:07,225 --> 00:11:08,225
It pains me deeply.

171
00:11:09,025 --> 00:11:10,705
I will bear the twenty strokes alone

172
00:11:10,785 --> 00:11:12,305
to apologize to the people.

173
00:11:12,385 --> 00:11:13,225
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

174
00:11:17,305 --> 00:11:18,185
-Your Majesty.
-Your Majesty.

175
00:11:18,265 --> 00:11:21,385
-We will share Lord Meng's punishment.
-We will share Lord Meng's punishment.

176
00:11:22,905 --> 00:11:24,385
I head the Office of Public Inquiry.

177
00:11:25,465 --> 00:11:26,825
I should bear it alone.

178
00:11:26,905 --> 00:11:28,905
I am its deputy.
I share the responsibility.

179
00:11:28,985 --> 00:11:30,905
I serve there too.
We stand together in hardship.

180
00:11:30,985 --> 00:11:33,025
The case remains unsolved.
I cannot shirk my duty.

181
00:11:33,105 --> 00:11:33,945
I share the responsibility too.

182
00:12:41,345 --> 00:12:42,945
That must hurt terribly.

183
00:12:43,705 --> 00:12:44,985
You've been frail since childhood.

184
00:12:45,465 --> 00:12:47,185
Though they're only surface wounds,

185
00:12:47,265 --> 00:12:49,185
you still need proper rest and care.

186
00:12:49,865 --> 00:12:51,345
What I did this time

187
00:12:51,825 --> 00:12:53,225
wasn't a rash impulse.

188
00:12:53,305 --> 00:12:54,465
I understand.

189
00:12:56,105 --> 00:12:57,065
Back then,

190
00:12:57,585 --> 00:12:59,785
I placed seventeenth in the first class
of the metropolitan examination.

191
00:13:00,265 --> 00:13:01,985
When I first entered the Hanlin Academy,

192
00:13:02,705 --> 00:13:05,145
I was just as full of youthful zeal.

193
00:13:06,625 --> 00:13:08,265
Then I met your father,

194
00:13:08,345 --> 00:13:09,785
became a wife and mother,

195
00:13:10,385 --> 00:13:11,665
and had no regrets.

196
00:13:12,665 --> 00:13:14,105
But today,

197
00:13:14,185 --> 00:13:16,265
seeing you stand
with the Office of Public Inquiry,

198
00:13:17,385 --> 00:13:19,425
I saw my younger self in you.

199
00:13:20,265 --> 00:13:21,945
And compared with me,

200
00:13:22,025 --> 00:13:23,665
you have an even greater sense of duty.

201
00:13:25,625 --> 00:13:26,665
Mother.

202
00:13:26,745 --> 00:13:28,345
I'm truly proud of you.

203
00:13:29,665 --> 00:13:30,505
Mother.

204
00:13:32,425 --> 00:13:33,945
Because I've walked this road,

205
00:13:34,705 --> 00:13:36,625
I know how hard it is.

206
00:13:38,105 --> 00:13:40,065
I only did what I should.

207
00:13:41,985 --> 00:13:43,465
Precisely because the road ahead is hard,

208
00:13:44,225 --> 00:13:46,345
Lord Meng is all the more admirable.

209
00:13:47,025 --> 00:13:47,985
As a woman,

210
00:13:48,065 --> 00:13:49,505
she leads the Office of Public Inquiry

211
00:13:50,065 --> 00:13:51,385
and pledged before everyone.

212
00:13:52,105 --> 00:13:53,945
She is a model for all women.

213
00:13:55,025 --> 00:13:56,545
I need to recover quickly

214
00:13:56,625 --> 00:13:57,665
and go help her.

215
00:13:59,505 --> 00:14:00,545
My Li'er.

216
00:14:02,265 --> 00:14:03,585
You've truly grown up.

217
00:14:11,225 --> 00:14:12,225
I wonder

218
00:14:12,305 --> 00:14:14,025
how Brother and A-Nian's injuries are.

219
00:14:16,425 --> 00:14:17,505
Father.

220
00:14:17,585 --> 00:14:19,425
Why can Zhili eat in her room

221
00:14:19,505 --> 00:14:20,985
while I have to come to the hall?

222
00:14:21,065 --> 00:14:22,345
I only walked a few steps,

223
00:14:23,345 --> 00:14:24,305
and my back already hurts again.

224
00:14:24,385 --> 00:14:25,465
If it's too much,

225
00:14:25,545 --> 00:14:26,785
go back and rest.

226
00:14:27,345 --> 00:14:28,265
How could I?

227
00:14:28,745 --> 00:14:29,665
Pain is pain,

228
00:14:29,745 --> 00:14:30,985
but I still have to eat.

229
00:14:31,505 --> 00:14:33,665
Besides, Father cooked this himself.

230
00:14:33,745 --> 00:14:34,905
It'd be a shame not to eat it.

231
00:14:37,225 --> 00:14:38,065
Easy, Brother.

232
00:14:39,385 --> 00:14:40,945
They hit your back.

233
00:14:41,025 --> 00:14:43,105
Why? Does your rear hurt too?

234
00:14:43,185 --> 00:14:45,545
I took a full twenty strokes!

235
00:14:45,625 --> 00:14:47,385
It takes a hundred days
for bone and sinew to heal.

236
00:14:47,465 --> 00:14:48,665
My back

237
00:14:48,745 --> 00:14:50,265
probably doesn't have
a patch of good skin left.

238
00:14:52,305 --> 00:14:53,145
A-Nian, sit down.

239
00:14:53,225 --> 00:14:54,065
All right.

240
00:14:54,545 --> 00:14:55,425
Look at you.

241
00:14:56,385 --> 00:14:58,425
You've spent too long in pleasure houses,

242
00:14:58,505 --> 00:15:00,145
and your martial skills are getting rusty.

243
00:15:00,225 --> 00:15:01,185
You need more practice.

244
00:15:02,425 --> 00:15:03,385
Look at A-Nian.

245
00:15:03,985 --> 00:15:05,425
He took the same twenty strokes.

246
00:15:05,505 --> 00:15:07,105
When have you heard him complain?

247
00:15:07,665 --> 00:15:08,945
I'm used to rough treatment.

248
00:15:09,465 --> 00:15:10,385
Unlike Brother,

249
00:15:10,465 --> 00:15:13,185
who runs between Changle Street
and the Office every day.

250
00:15:13,265 --> 00:15:14,625
It's exhausting enough.

251
00:15:14,705 --> 00:15:17,625
That's the responsibility
a Shen man should have.

252
00:15:17,705 --> 00:15:19,865
Leading the Divine Guard
at such a young age,

253
00:15:19,945 --> 00:15:21,225
charging into battle,

254
00:15:21,305 --> 00:15:22,665
yet attentive and caring at home.

255
00:15:23,385 --> 00:15:25,425
Well done. Come, drink.

256
00:15:25,505 --> 00:15:26,545
Thank you, Father.

257
00:15:29,745 --> 00:15:30,585
Father.

258
00:15:31,145 --> 00:15:33,185
Your fine Shen son here

259
00:15:33,745 --> 00:15:35,065
is tough as old leather.

260
00:15:35,145 --> 00:15:36,945
I can't compete with him in toughness.

261
00:15:38,465 --> 00:15:40,825
But I'm much stronger than Zhili.

262
00:15:40,905 --> 00:15:42,465
She still can't get out of bed.

263
00:15:43,305 --> 00:15:45,065
My son has really accomplished something.

264
00:15:45,145 --> 00:15:46,145
As her elder brother,

265
00:15:46,225 --> 00:15:47,545
you're actually comparing yourself
to your sister?

266
00:15:47,625 --> 00:15:48,785
Aren't you ashamed?

267
00:15:52,585 --> 00:15:54,545
I wonder how Zhili's injuries are.

268
00:15:55,945 --> 00:15:57,385
Your mother is caring for her.

269
00:15:57,465 --> 00:15:58,305
She'll be fine.

270
00:15:58,385 --> 00:15:59,225
Eat.

271
00:15:59,305 --> 00:16:00,425
Grand Tutor.

272
00:16:01,305 --> 00:16:03,145
The tonics you asked for are ready.

273
00:16:03,905 --> 00:16:04,745
Father.

274
00:16:04,825 --> 00:16:06,345
Let me take them to Zhili.

275
00:16:07,225 --> 00:16:08,065
All right.

276
00:16:08,865 --> 00:16:10,105
Thank you, Father.

277
00:16:15,465 --> 00:16:16,705
A-Nian really is

278
00:16:16,785 --> 00:16:18,145
made of sturdy stuff.

279
00:16:19,945 --> 00:16:21,625
Father, look.

280
00:16:21,705 --> 00:16:22,905
My standing in this family

281
00:16:22,985 --> 00:16:24,145
is lower than dust.

282
00:16:24,225 --> 00:16:25,785
With all this good food and drink,

283
00:16:25,865 --> 00:16:27,185
you still can't keep your mouth shut?

284
00:16:27,265 --> 00:16:28,145
Just eat.

285
00:16:43,465 --> 00:16:44,305
Thank you, Father.

286
00:16:51,185 --> 00:16:52,025
Brat.

287
00:16:53,865 --> 00:16:55,065
Here.

288
00:17:17,145 --> 00:17:18,465
How did you get beaten this badly?

289
00:17:19,345 --> 00:17:21,585
Fuzhi, please don't cry.

290
00:17:22,345 --> 00:17:23,625
I've been hurt

291
00:17:24,385 --> 00:17:25,825
much worse than this before.

292
00:17:26,825 --> 00:17:28,305
I'll be fine in a couple of days.

293
00:17:30,985 --> 00:17:33,185
No matter how badly you were hurt before,

294
00:17:33,265 --> 00:17:34,705
you always smiled and said you were fine.

295
00:17:36,625 --> 00:17:38,585
Those learned male officials at court

296
00:17:39,185 --> 00:17:41,105
don't help you investigate
the Tiger's Roar Gang,

297
00:17:41,185 --> 00:17:42,185
and they treat you like this?

298
00:17:42,265 --> 00:17:43,745
I'm going to ask His Majesty myself.

299
00:17:44,585 --> 00:17:46,065
You only want what's best for Daning.

300
00:17:46,145 --> 00:17:47,545
Why couldn't he protect you?

301
00:17:51,985 --> 00:17:53,825
Miss Yan was looking for me?

302
00:18:00,385 --> 00:18:01,305
Your Majesty.

303
00:18:01,385 --> 00:18:03,145
Mengmeng is my only family.

304
00:18:03,225 --> 00:18:04,345
All this way,

305
00:18:04,425 --> 00:18:06,265
she's been framed and bullied,

306
00:18:06,345 --> 00:18:07,985
humiliated and threatened,

307
00:18:08,065 --> 00:18:10,065
and nearly killed time and again.

308
00:18:10,145 --> 00:18:12,625
The people who targeted her
were all vicious criminals.

309
00:18:12,705 --> 00:18:13,625
But this time,

310
00:18:13,705 --> 00:18:15,545
Your Majesty personally
ordered her punished.

311
00:18:15,625 --> 00:18:18,065
-Fuzhi.
-To give the officials an answer,

312
00:18:18,145 --> 00:18:20,945
so you used my Mengmeng as your weapon.

313
00:18:21,025 --> 00:18:23,345
But she's precious to me too.

314
00:18:23,425 --> 00:18:24,545
If after ten days

315
00:18:24,625 --> 00:18:26,065
she still hasn't solved it,

316
00:18:26,145 --> 00:18:28,385
I only ask Your Majesty to spare her life.

317
00:18:28,465 --> 00:18:29,385
Strip her of rank
and make her a commoner.

318
00:18:29,465 --> 00:18:31,145
I'll take her back to Shazhou.

319
00:18:31,225 --> 00:18:32,305
From then on,

320
00:18:32,385 --> 00:18:34,545
I won't let anyone hurt her again.

321
00:18:34,625 --> 00:18:35,465
I've said what I came to say.

322
00:18:35,545 --> 00:18:36,985
Please punish me, Your Majesty.

323
00:18:38,825 --> 00:18:39,945
Miss Yan.

324
00:18:40,705 --> 00:18:41,745
I promise you.

325
00:18:42,905 --> 00:18:45,145
What you fear will not happen.

326
00:18:47,865 --> 00:18:49,425
Your Majesty's word is absolute.

327
00:18:49,985 --> 00:18:51,945
I'll remember it for Mengmeng.

328
00:18:56,665 --> 00:18:58,425
I won't disturb
Your Majesty and Mengmeng.

329
00:19:11,225 --> 00:19:12,065
Your Majesty.

330
00:19:14,345 --> 00:19:15,185
Fuzhi

331
00:19:16,705 --> 00:19:18,305
is worried for my safety.

332
00:19:19,305 --> 00:19:20,585
Please don't blame her.

333
00:19:20,665 --> 00:19:21,625
She's right.

334
00:19:22,185 --> 00:19:23,425
This is my fault.

335
00:19:26,585 --> 00:19:28,065
I failed to protect you.

336
00:19:29,985 --> 00:19:31,745
I brought wound medicine
sent as tribute from Beijian.

337
00:19:32,785 --> 00:19:34,625
It relieves pain and prevents scarring.

338
00:19:35,505 --> 00:19:36,505
I'll apply it for you.

339
00:19:42,905 --> 00:19:43,745
I...

340
00:19:45,865 --> 00:19:47,225
dare not trouble Your Majesty.

341
00:19:47,785 --> 00:19:49,905
You won't even let me
do this small thing for you?

342
00:19:56,465 --> 00:19:57,345
It may sting at first.

343
00:19:57,985 --> 00:19:59,265
There may be a burning sensation.

344
00:20:01,145 --> 00:20:02,225
I'll be careful.

345
00:20:45,305 --> 00:20:47,305
This mark on your back

346
00:20:48,265 --> 00:20:49,345
is rather unusual.

347
00:20:49,425 --> 00:20:50,545
A mark?

348
00:20:52,585 --> 00:20:54,265
Which one do you mean, Your Majesty?

349
00:20:54,985 --> 00:20:57,105
I was beaten often as a child

350
00:20:57,785 --> 00:20:59,465
and have many scars.

351
00:21:00,185 --> 00:21:01,185
I don't remember them all.

352
00:21:02,985 --> 00:21:03,865
Your Majesty.

353
00:21:03,945 --> 00:21:06,025
The ten-day deadline is close.

354
00:21:06,105 --> 00:21:08,145
Perhaps only by finding the valley

355
00:21:08,985 --> 00:21:10,745
can we stop the Infinity Pill spreading.

356
00:21:11,665 --> 00:21:13,465
Tomorrow, I want to search
the outskirts with Yinqing.

357
00:21:13,545 --> 00:21:14,425
Don't concern yourself with anything.

358
00:21:15,705 --> 00:21:17,465
I've ordered Huang Bo to find the valley.

359
00:21:18,545 --> 00:21:20,065
Your priority now

360
00:21:20,145 --> 00:21:21,905
is to rest and recover your strength.

361
00:21:22,665 --> 00:21:23,505
Otherwise,

362
00:21:24,105 --> 00:21:26,425
I may truly take away
that official robe of yours.

363
00:21:29,105 --> 00:21:30,105
I obey.

364
00:21:40,545 --> 00:21:42,305
The Mystic Bird guards Zhongwan.

365
00:21:42,785 --> 00:21:45,025
Royal descendants bear a secret mark
on the shoulder from childhood,

366
00:21:45,105 --> 00:21:46,345
which becomes clearer with age.

367
00:21:46,425 --> 00:21:47,745
Your Majesty saw it clearly.

368
00:21:47,825 --> 00:21:49,185
The mark on Lord Meng's shoulder

369
00:21:49,265 --> 00:21:50,745
is indeed the Mystic Bird totem.

370
00:21:50,825 --> 00:21:52,905
Though the mark overlaps with scars,

371
00:21:52,985 --> 00:21:53,905
it is unmistakable.

372
00:21:55,065 --> 00:21:56,425
I vaguely remember

373
00:21:56,505 --> 00:21:58,985
the Zhongwan royals Father executed

374
00:21:59,065 --> 00:22:00,425
also bore such a mark.

375
00:22:00,985 --> 00:22:02,465
But I was young then.

376
00:22:03,145 --> 00:22:04,305
As for what happened back then,

377
00:22:04,385 --> 00:22:06,425
only the Grand Tutor knows clearly.

378
00:22:06,505 --> 00:22:07,705
More than ten years ago,

379
00:22:07,785 --> 00:22:10,385
the Zhongwan royal house
coveted Daning's riches

380
00:22:10,465 --> 00:22:11,585
and provoked us repeatedly.

381
00:22:12,145 --> 00:22:13,145
The late Emperor had enough

382
00:22:13,225 --> 00:22:14,345
and led the campaign himself.

383
00:22:14,905 --> 00:22:17,145
The Zhongwan royals resisted to the end,

384
00:22:17,225 --> 00:22:19,585
but were crushed by his iron hand.

385
00:22:19,665 --> 00:22:21,665
The four-year-old Zhongwan princess

386
00:22:21,745 --> 00:22:23,345
also died inside the palace.

387
00:22:23,985 --> 00:22:25,585
Only a band of death-sworn guards

388
00:22:25,665 --> 00:22:28,425
broke through with a general's son.

389
00:22:30,225 --> 00:22:31,465
Judging by their ages,

390
00:22:31,545 --> 00:22:33,545
Lord Meng and the Zhongwan princess
would be the same age.

391
00:22:33,625 --> 00:22:35,585
But wasn't the Zhongwan princess dead?

392
00:22:35,665 --> 00:22:37,225
It now appears

393
00:22:37,305 --> 00:22:39,425
the dead princess may have been a decoy.

394
00:22:40,425 --> 00:22:42,105
Perhaps Zhongwan remnants

395
00:22:42,185 --> 00:22:43,425
wanted to restore their nation

396
00:22:43,505 --> 00:22:45,585
and preserve a line of royal blood.

397
00:22:46,425 --> 00:22:48,265
Huiyin House and the Blood Moon Society

398
00:22:48,345 --> 00:22:49,705
were already plotting a restoration.

399
00:22:49,785 --> 00:22:51,825
Situ Xue is also very close to Lord Meng.

400
00:22:52,505 --> 00:22:53,345
Perhaps

401
00:22:53,945 --> 00:22:56,385
Lord Meng is one of them,
sent to infiltrate the court.

402
00:22:58,385 --> 00:23:00,345
Daning's ancestral law still states

403
00:23:00,425 --> 00:23:01,705
that Zhongwan survivors
must live as slaves or servants

404
00:23:01,785 --> 00:23:03,025
and may never serve as court officials.

405
00:23:03,105 --> 00:23:04,585
The late Emperor enacted this to prevent

406
00:23:04,665 --> 00:23:07,505
traitors from disrupting the court
and harming the people.

407
00:23:08,185 --> 00:23:11,025
Now a Zhongwan restoration
is stirring in secret.

408
00:23:11,585 --> 00:23:12,865
Its royal bloodline

409
00:23:12,945 --> 00:23:15,225
must be eradicated completely.

410
00:23:15,865 --> 00:23:18,265
Grand Tutor, are you asking me
to execute Lord Meng?

411
00:23:29,385 --> 00:23:32,385
I have long since retired.

412
00:23:32,465 --> 00:23:34,585
I should not interfere in court affairs.

413
00:23:34,665 --> 00:23:36,065
But Your Majesty and Meng Tinghui

414
00:23:36,145 --> 00:23:36,985
have grown exceedingly close.

415
00:23:37,065 --> 00:23:38,505
There is already criticism outside.

416
00:23:39,065 --> 00:23:40,025
I am deeply concerned.

417
00:23:40,825 --> 00:23:42,745
Please think carefully, Your Majesty.

418
00:23:42,825 --> 00:23:45,105
Be more cautious with Meng Tinghui,

419
00:23:45,185 --> 00:23:46,985
and remain vigilant

420
00:23:47,065 --> 00:23:49,465
against the Blood Moon Society.

421
00:23:49,545 --> 00:23:50,585
Only then

422
00:23:50,665 --> 00:23:52,025
can we guard against the unforeseen

423
00:23:52,105 --> 00:23:53,745
and keep the court stable.

424
00:23:55,785 --> 00:23:57,465
Father, don't worry.

425
00:23:57,545 --> 00:23:59,185
His Majesty already told me
to watch Huiyin House

426
00:23:59,265 --> 00:24:00,625
and secretly investigate
the Blood Moon Society.

427
00:24:01,185 --> 00:24:03,625
His Majesty would never put
private feelings before public duty.

428
00:24:04,385 --> 00:24:06,945
Still, Lord Meng's identity

429
00:24:07,025 --> 00:24:08,745
truly warrants renewed scrutiny.

430
00:24:12,905 --> 00:24:14,785
This concerns an old feud
between two states.

431
00:24:15,265 --> 00:24:16,625
I will not take it lightly

432
00:24:16,705 --> 00:24:17,705
or act on emotion.

433
00:24:18,425 --> 00:24:19,625
Meng Tinghui and the Office
of Public Inquiry,

434
00:24:20,105 --> 00:24:21,425
I will consider everything carefully.

435
00:24:22,625 --> 00:24:23,785
Your Majesty is wise.

436
00:24:24,945 --> 00:24:26,465
Until there is a conclusion,

437
00:24:26,545 --> 00:24:28,225
we will keep this strictly secret.

438
00:24:28,305 --> 00:24:30,345
Zhishu, especially you.

439
00:24:32,185 --> 00:24:33,825
Father, I have enough self-control

440
00:24:33,905 --> 00:24:34,865
to know better.

441
00:25:08,425 --> 00:25:09,905
The Tiger's Roar Gang's storerooms,

442
00:25:09,985 --> 00:25:10,825
hidden cellars,

443
00:25:11,425 --> 00:25:12,505
even the caves behind the mountain

444
00:25:12,585 --> 00:25:13,505
have all been searched.

445
00:25:14,665 --> 00:25:16,305
Not a single Infinity Pill was found.

446
00:25:16,385 --> 00:25:18,665
And for dozens of miles
around their stronghold,

447
00:25:18,745 --> 00:25:20,065
there is nothing but sand and stone.

448
00:25:20,145 --> 00:25:21,465
It cannot be where the poison is made.

449
00:25:21,545 --> 00:25:22,425
Logically,

450
00:25:22,505 --> 00:25:23,785
Ling Yunfei is badly wounded.

451
00:25:24,345 --> 00:25:25,745
If he doesn't want to bleed to death,

452
00:25:25,825 --> 00:25:27,065
his hiding place

453
00:25:27,145 --> 00:25:28,385
shouldn't be far from the capital.

454
00:25:29,705 --> 00:25:32,065
A-Nian, you searched
the valleys outside the capital.

455
00:25:32,545 --> 00:25:34,545
Did you truly find no clues at all?

456
00:25:35,305 --> 00:25:36,825
We searched seventeen valleys.

457
00:25:37,305 --> 00:25:39,425
Each was compared with the painting.

458
00:25:39,505 --> 00:25:40,945
Huang Bo has led the Divine Guard

459
00:25:41,025 --> 00:25:42,265
deep into the miasma forest.

460
00:25:42,345 --> 00:25:43,945
No word has come back yet.

461
00:25:44,625 --> 00:25:47,225
Though the gang's stronghold is destroyed,

462
00:25:47,305 --> 00:25:48,825
as long as Ling Yunfei lives,

463
00:25:48,905 --> 00:25:50,585
given that madman's nature,

464
00:25:50,665 --> 00:25:52,905
he will plot an even crueler revenge.

465
00:25:55,985 --> 00:25:57,065
My lord.

466
00:25:57,145 --> 00:25:57,985
Your wounds...

467
00:25:58,985 --> 00:26:00,305
I'm fine.

468
00:26:00,385 --> 00:26:02,345
Zhili, draft a memorial now.

469
00:26:02,425 --> 00:26:03,985
Ask His Majesty for reinforcements.

470
00:26:04,065 --> 00:26:06,145
We must find where the poison is made
as soon as possible.

471
00:26:06,705 --> 00:26:07,625
Otherwise,

472
00:26:08,705 --> 00:26:09,785
the consequences are unthinkable.

473
00:27:45,305 --> 00:27:46,905
Lock the chains tighter.

474
00:27:46,985 --> 00:27:47,825
Yes.

475
00:27:52,705 --> 00:27:53,545
Chief.

476
00:27:54,105 --> 00:27:55,265
As you ordered,

477
00:27:55,345 --> 00:27:56,545
the dose of Fuqing Grass

478
00:27:56,625 --> 00:27:57,505
has been tripled.

479
00:27:59,865 --> 00:28:02,425
What an intoxicating fragrance.

480
00:28:05,985 --> 00:28:07,185
But it is still not enough.

481
00:28:07,265 --> 00:28:08,385
Increase the dose.

482
00:28:08,465 --> 00:28:09,425
Within ten days,

483
00:28:09,505 --> 00:28:11,665
harvest every stalk of Fuqing Grass
in Wangxian Valley.

484
00:28:11,745 --> 00:28:12,665
This time,

485
00:28:13,545 --> 00:28:14,785
either Meng Tinghui dies,

486
00:28:14,865 --> 00:28:16,585
or I, Ling Yunfei, do.

487
00:28:16,665 --> 00:28:18,705
Then you should prepare your funeral.

488
00:28:19,865 --> 00:28:22,185
Mr. Shangguan honors us with a visit.

489
00:28:23,105 --> 00:28:24,785
It seems you've finally lost patience.

490
00:28:24,865 --> 00:28:26,465
To get revenge on Meng Tinghui,

491
00:28:26,985 --> 00:28:29,585
you spread the Infinity Pill
at Bofeng Tavern.

492
00:28:29,665 --> 00:28:31,465
Now the whole city is under lockdown.

493
00:28:31,545 --> 00:28:33,905
Do you intend to ruin
our business with your own hands?

494
00:28:34,385 --> 00:28:36,305
You hide in the shadows all day

495
00:28:36,385 --> 00:28:37,785
to make petty profits.

496
00:28:39,065 --> 00:28:40,385
Is that

497
00:28:40,465 --> 00:28:42,025
all you cowards aspire to?

498
00:28:42,105 --> 00:28:43,225
Listen carefully.

499
00:28:43,745 --> 00:28:45,985
If you dare trouble Meng Tinghui again,

500
00:28:46,065 --> 00:28:48,065
I don't mind sending you
to your grave first.

501
00:28:48,625 --> 00:28:50,945
What exactly is your relationship
with Meng Tinghui?

502
00:28:51,865 --> 00:28:53,145
Every other sentence is about her,

503
00:28:53,905 --> 00:28:55,345
and you protect her at every turn.

504
00:28:55,425 --> 00:28:56,905
Our business

505
00:28:57,585 --> 00:28:58,425
together

506
00:28:59,105 --> 00:29:00,345
ends here.

507
00:29:11,305 --> 00:29:13,025
You think I'll just sit and wait to die?

508
00:29:13,105 --> 00:29:16,425
Look. This is the Infinity Pill's
true power.

509
00:29:17,065 --> 00:29:18,625
I'll use an army of poisoned men

510
00:29:18,705 --> 00:29:20,385
to bathe the capital in blood.

511
00:29:20,465 --> 00:29:21,945
Meng Tinghui, prepare to die.

512
00:29:31,665 --> 00:29:34,305
(Bofeng Tavern Temporary Closure Notice)

513
00:29:40,705 --> 00:29:41,785
I wanted to save enough silver

514
00:29:41,865 --> 00:29:43,105
to buy a large house.

515
00:29:43,585 --> 00:29:44,425
The two of us

516
00:29:44,505 --> 00:29:45,745
could live comfortably there.

517
00:29:47,425 --> 00:29:48,505
Now I've lost everything.

518
00:29:51,745 --> 00:29:53,985
I snatched my life back from death

519
00:29:54,065 --> 00:29:55,305
thanks to you, Mengmeng.

520
00:29:57,425 --> 00:29:58,985
It was thanks to Lord Shen.

521
00:29:59,065 --> 00:30:00,625
To get medicine for you,

522
00:30:00,705 --> 00:30:02,665
he even pawned the jade pendant
gifted by the late Emperor.

523
00:30:04,025 --> 00:30:07,225
His Majesty knew he was saving a life
and did not punish him.

524
00:30:08,025 --> 00:30:09,425
But Zhili told me

525
00:30:09,505 --> 00:30:13,065
Grand Tutor Shen made him kneel
in the ancestral hall for three days.

526
00:30:16,505 --> 00:30:17,705
He truly cares about you.

527
00:30:22,025 --> 00:30:23,425
After narrowly escaping death,

528
00:30:24,105 --> 00:30:25,505
I realized wealth is easy to find,

529
00:30:25,585 --> 00:30:26,625
but a true friend is rare.

530
00:30:26,705 --> 00:30:28,305
Since you all gave everything for me,

531
00:30:29,225 --> 00:30:30,265
I should live well.

532
00:30:33,065 --> 00:30:34,905
Bofeng Tavern will close for two months.

533
00:30:34,985 --> 00:30:36,705
I'll create more new dishes

534
00:30:36,785 --> 00:30:38,225
so when we reopen,

535
00:30:38,305 --> 00:30:40,345
the capital's diners will be amazed.

536
00:30:42,265 --> 00:30:43,865
But you're not fully recovered.

537
00:30:43,945 --> 00:30:45,105
Bofeng Tavern still isn't safe.

538
00:30:45,185 --> 00:30:46,985
Stay at the Office for now.

539
00:30:47,065 --> 00:30:48,025
I'll be there to look after you.

540
00:30:48,105 --> 00:30:49,025
You...

541
00:30:49,105 --> 00:30:52,065
You've been buried in chasing Ling Yunfei.
How could you possibly look after me?

542
00:30:52,145 --> 00:30:54,025
The military pledge deadline is near,

543
00:30:54,985 --> 00:30:56,385
but every lead on Ling Yunfei is gone.

544
00:30:56,465 --> 00:30:58,505
The Light Riders have searched for days,

545
00:30:58,585 --> 00:30:59,825
yet no one has reported back.

546
00:31:00,625 --> 00:31:02,865
Even His Majesty hasn't come
to the Office for days.

547
00:31:03,585 --> 00:31:05,145
Something feels strange.

548
00:31:06,745 --> 00:31:07,585
All right.

549
00:31:07,665 --> 00:31:09,345
Enough thinking. Let's go out.

550
00:31:18,145 --> 00:31:19,265
-Yinqing.
-Lord Meng.

551
00:31:19,785 --> 00:31:21,905
-Proprietor Yan.
-You went to Huiyin House.

552
00:31:21,985 --> 00:31:23,705
Mistress Situ often travels
to the frontier.

553
00:31:23,785 --> 00:31:26,185
She has rare medicines, candles,
and incense not found in the capital.

554
00:31:26,985 --> 00:31:29,145
Proprietor Yan has only just recovered
and needs to rebuild her strength.

555
00:31:29,225 --> 00:31:30,385
Thank you for taking the trouble.

556
00:31:31,625 --> 00:31:34,265
Any progress from Commandant Di's
search of the valleys?

557
00:31:34,345 --> 00:31:37,385
Why has not a single message
reached the Office from the Light Riders?

558
00:31:37,465 --> 00:31:39,665
His Majesty personally deployed
the Divine Guard.

559
00:31:39,745 --> 00:31:40,785
All intelligence

560
00:31:41,385 --> 00:31:42,825
is reported directly to the throne.

561
00:31:44,625 --> 00:31:45,865
But I did hear some good news.

562
00:31:45,945 --> 00:31:46,945
I happened to hear

563
00:31:47,025 --> 00:31:48,625
the Light Riders found a valley

564
00:31:49,225 --> 00:31:50,785
somewhat like the one in the painting.

565
00:31:51,585 --> 00:31:53,545
But the memorial you submitted

566
00:31:53,625 --> 00:31:55,065
requesting reinforcements

567
00:31:55,625 --> 00:31:56,745
still has not been approved.

568
00:31:58,865 --> 00:32:01,425
The Divine Guard should assist
the Office in its investigations.

569
00:32:01,945 --> 00:32:03,585
Yet now they are bypassing me.

570
00:32:04,145 --> 00:32:05,185
Lend me this candle.

571
00:32:06,425 --> 00:32:08,265
Your Majesty, the Light Rider units report

572
00:32:08,345 --> 00:32:09,785
that Huang Bo disappeared

573
00:32:09,865 --> 00:32:11,945
at the last valley still unsearched,

574
00:32:12,025 --> 00:32:12,945
Wangxian Valley.

575
00:32:13,025 --> 00:32:14,465
The terrain there is treacherous,

576
00:32:14,545 --> 00:32:15,745
and mist shrouds it year-round,

577
00:32:15,825 --> 00:32:16,665
obscuring all visibility.

578
00:32:16,745 --> 00:32:18,065
At the valley entrance, the Light Riders

579
00:32:18,145 --> 00:32:19,425
found Huang Bo's dagger.

580
00:32:19,985 --> 00:32:21,865
Huang Bo never loses
anything he carries.

581
00:32:22,425 --> 00:32:23,745
Could something have happened to him?

582
00:32:23,825 --> 00:32:25,265
Take the Light Riders
and search the mountain at once.

583
00:32:25,345 --> 00:32:26,985
Should we inform Lord Meng?

584
00:32:27,905 --> 00:32:28,985
As for this valley,

585
00:32:29,065 --> 00:32:31,025
we have no proof yet
that Fuqing Grass grows there.

586
00:32:31,105 --> 00:32:32,265
Do not alarm her for now.

587
00:32:32,825 --> 00:32:34,985
-Investigate it thoroughly first.
-I understand.

588
00:32:35,065 --> 00:32:37,465
Your Majesty, this old servant has sinned!

589
00:32:38,025 --> 00:32:38,945
Not again.

590
00:32:39,665 --> 00:32:41,345
With Huang Bo away these past few days,

591
00:32:41,425 --> 00:32:43,585
he has nagged my ears raw.

592
00:32:44,305 --> 00:32:45,225
Go help me

593
00:32:45,305 --> 00:32:46,505
stop Chief Steward You before you leave.

594
00:32:47,585 --> 00:32:48,425
Yes.

595
00:32:54,265 --> 00:32:56,825
Your Majesty personally risked yourself
at the Tiger's Roar Gang.

596
00:32:56,905 --> 00:32:59,665
This old servant fears for your safety.

597
00:32:59,745 --> 00:33:01,105
Every day my heart

598
00:33:01,185 --> 00:33:03,465
is in my throat.

599
00:33:03,545 --> 00:33:05,745
I have failed the late Emperor.

600
00:33:06,425 --> 00:33:07,425
Commandant Di,

601
00:33:07,505 --> 00:33:08,745
lend me your sword.

602
00:33:08,825 --> 00:33:10,945
I'll go meet the late Emperor first!

603
00:33:22,145 --> 00:33:25,425
Commandant Di, I was beside myself.

604
00:33:25,985 --> 00:33:28,625
His Majesty has stayed up late
reviewing memorials.

605
00:33:29,105 --> 00:33:32,065
It seems he caught a chill.

606
00:33:32,145 --> 00:33:34,425
The physician prescribed this remedy.

607
00:33:34,985 --> 00:33:36,345
Your Majesty,

608
00:33:36,425 --> 00:33:38,385
you must take care of yourself.

609
00:33:39,225 --> 00:33:40,465
-Your Maj...
-Go back.

610
00:33:43,065 --> 00:33:44,105
Your Majesty.

611
00:33:44,185 --> 00:33:46,465
You must take good care of yourself.

612
00:33:46,545 --> 00:33:47,665
Your Majesty.

613
00:33:47,745 --> 00:33:48,745
Your Majesty.

614
00:34:00,305 --> 00:34:01,825
Can you stop bothering me?

615
00:34:06,265 --> 00:34:08,065
So Your Majesty finds me bothersome.

616
00:34:08,145 --> 00:34:09,945
Is that why you haven't visited
the Office lately?

617
00:34:10,025 --> 00:34:11,745
I thought it was Chief Steward You.

618
00:34:12,385 --> 00:34:14,025
This is from Huiyin House.

619
00:34:14,625 --> 00:34:16,265
Miss Situ specially blended it.

620
00:34:16,345 --> 00:34:18,145
She said it calms the mind
and restores the spirit.

621
00:34:18,225 --> 00:34:21,065
You've exhausted yourself lately
over the Infinity Pill.

622
00:34:21,825 --> 00:34:22,665
You should try it.

623
00:34:22,745 --> 00:34:24,465
You came here specifically today

624
00:34:25,145 --> 00:34:26,305
not just to bring this gift, did you?

625
00:34:26,865 --> 00:34:28,145
The memorial I submitted

626
00:34:28,225 --> 00:34:30,305
requesting more staff for the Office

627
00:34:30,905 --> 00:34:32,025
has yet to receive imperial approval.

628
00:34:37,425 --> 00:34:38,465
This drawing...

629
00:34:39,705 --> 00:34:40,545
do you recognize it?

630
00:34:48,905 --> 00:34:49,865
I do not.

631
00:34:49,945 --> 00:34:52,305
This is the Heaven-ordained Mystic Bird
revered in Zhongwan.

632
00:34:52,945 --> 00:34:54,585
It is said to foretell good and ill

633
00:34:54,665 --> 00:34:56,105
and protect the nation's destiny.

634
00:34:56,185 --> 00:34:58,505
Later, Zhongwan submitted to Daning.

635
00:34:58,585 --> 00:35:01,305
Do you think Daning's policy
toward Zhongwan survivors

636
00:35:01,385 --> 00:35:02,385
should be reformed?

637
00:35:02,465 --> 00:35:03,625
Your Majesty.

638
00:35:04,585 --> 00:35:07,145
I've only read about Zhongwan's past
in historical texts.

639
00:35:08,305 --> 00:35:09,505
I don't know what truly happened.

640
00:35:13,745 --> 00:35:15,185
Miss Yan only just escaped danger.

641
00:35:15,905 --> 00:35:17,265
I don't want you risking yourself again.

642
00:35:17,945 --> 00:35:20,305
I have decided on another plan.

643
00:35:20,385 --> 00:35:22,625
-The Office should leave this case.
-Your Majesty.

644
00:35:22,705 --> 00:35:24,705
I know the difference
between public and private.

645
00:35:24,785 --> 00:35:26,025
What happened to Fuzhi

646
00:35:26,105 --> 00:35:27,385
torments me day and night.

647
00:35:27,465 --> 00:35:29,265
Even if I do harbor selfish motives,

648
00:35:29,345 --> 00:35:30,665
so what?

649
00:35:30,745 --> 00:35:31,905
The Ling Yunfei case

650
00:35:31,985 --> 00:35:34,105
has been pursued by the Office all along,

651
00:35:34,185 --> 00:35:35,865
and I am the best person for it.

652
00:35:35,945 --> 00:35:37,305
Please withdraw your order.

653
00:35:37,385 --> 00:35:39,465
Ling Yunfei will not stop pursuing you.

654
00:35:39,545 --> 00:35:40,745
I am worried for your safety.

655
00:35:40,825 --> 00:35:42,585
Take some time to rest.

656
00:35:43,145 --> 00:35:44,665
Consider that my own selfishness.

657
00:35:46,345 --> 00:35:47,505
I feel Your Majesty

658
00:35:47,585 --> 00:35:49,225
has been acting strangely lately.

659
00:35:49,305 --> 00:35:50,905
Are you hiding something from me?

660
00:35:50,985 --> 00:35:52,025
Do not overthink it.

661
00:35:52,545 --> 00:35:53,985
Follow my decree.

662
00:35:59,905 --> 00:36:02,225
Your Majesty, of all the court officials,

663
00:36:02,305 --> 00:36:04,025
who knows Ling Yunfei
better than the Office?

664
00:36:04,105 --> 00:36:05,665
If Your Majesty is worried about me,

665
00:36:06,265 --> 00:36:07,745
you may send people with me.

666
00:36:08,465 --> 00:36:10,785
But if the Office is forced off this case,

667
00:36:10,865 --> 00:36:12,185
then I will go myself.

668
00:36:13,585 --> 00:36:14,705
If Your Majesty does not trust me,

669
00:36:15,705 --> 00:36:17,425
I need not wait for your decree.

670
00:36:19,265 --> 00:36:21,145
I already know where Wangxian Valley is.

671
00:36:21,225 --> 00:36:23,105
From the day we met,

672
00:36:24,225 --> 00:36:26,025
I knew this was your nature.

673
00:36:32,625 --> 00:36:33,825
I trust you.

674
00:36:34,825 --> 00:36:36,225
But that means allowing you
to place yourself in danger.

675
00:36:37,465 --> 00:36:39,585
I want this realm kept safe,

676
00:36:39,665 --> 00:36:40,625
but I also want you, Meng Tinghui,

677
00:36:40,705 --> 00:36:42,585
to return safe and whole.

678
00:36:43,545 --> 00:36:44,905
Wangxian Valley's terrain is complex.

679
00:36:45,585 --> 00:36:47,225
I will go with you.

680
00:37:25,945 --> 00:37:26,865
You're awake.

681
00:37:28,185 --> 00:37:29,705
Thank goodness.

682
00:37:29,785 --> 00:37:31,625
I was afraid you'd keep sleeping forever.

683
00:37:33,905 --> 00:37:35,145
Don't move.

684
00:37:40,425 --> 00:37:42,145
I'm only listening to your heartbeat,

685
00:37:42,225 --> 00:37:43,905
to see how well you're recovering.

686
00:37:51,945 --> 00:37:52,785
After taking my medicine,

687
00:37:52,865 --> 00:37:54,305
the snake venom is gone.

688
00:37:55,345 --> 00:37:56,465
However,

689
00:37:56,545 --> 00:37:59,425
your injured leg needs
a few more days of rest.

690
00:37:59,505 --> 00:38:00,945
Be good these next few days.

691
00:38:01,025 --> 00:38:02,585
Don't rush out and run around.

692
00:38:32,225 --> 00:38:33,705
Thank you for saving my life, miss.

693
00:38:33,785 --> 00:38:35,025
You're welcome.

694
00:38:35,105 --> 00:38:37,945
I'm A-Luo, a resident of Wangxian Valley.

695
00:38:38,665 --> 00:38:39,505
You...

696
00:38:40,385 --> 00:38:41,385
what is your name?

697
00:38:42,665 --> 00:38:44,145
My name is Huang Bo.

698
00:38:44,705 --> 00:38:45,665
Huang Bo.

699
00:38:58,105 --> 00:38:58,945
Miss A-Luo.

700
00:38:59,905 --> 00:39:00,745
Let me help you.

701
00:39:00,825 --> 00:39:01,865
Your leg hasn't healed yet.

702
00:39:01,945 --> 00:39:02,905
Don't move around.

703
00:39:06,305 --> 00:39:07,225
Old Huang!

704
00:39:07,505 --> 00:39:08,345
Old Huang!

705
00:39:10,025 --> 00:39:10,865
Young Master.

706
00:39:10,945 --> 00:39:11,785
Careful.

707
00:39:13,065 --> 00:39:13,945
How did you all get here?

708
00:39:19,745 --> 00:39:20,705
Miss A-Luo.

709
00:39:20,785 --> 00:39:22,025
There are so many of us,

710
00:39:22,105 --> 00:39:23,265
and we came to stay at your home
without warning.

711
00:39:23,345 --> 00:39:24,305
I'm sorry to impose.

712
00:39:24,385 --> 00:39:25,625
Not at all.

713
00:39:25,705 --> 00:39:27,745
Few outsiders ever come here.

714
00:39:27,825 --> 00:39:29,585
It's rare for my home
to be this lively.

715
00:39:29,665 --> 00:39:31,025
Besides,

716
00:39:31,105 --> 00:39:32,825
you're all so handsome,

717
00:39:33,385 --> 00:39:35,025
and dressed much better than we are.

718
00:39:43,705 --> 00:39:44,905
Miss A-Luo.

719
00:39:44,985 --> 00:39:46,905
The scenery shown in this painting,

720
00:39:46,985 --> 00:39:48,585
is it somewhere inside the valley?

721
00:39:49,145 --> 00:39:51,345
Our peaks are beautiful,

722
00:39:51,425 --> 00:39:52,465
wrapped in clouds and mist.

723
00:39:52,545 --> 00:39:55,185
From the valley floor,
it looks like an immortal realm.

724
00:39:55,745 --> 00:39:58,545
The scenery in this painting

725
00:39:59,385 --> 00:40:02,265
does indeed resemble our valley.

726
00:40:02,345 --> 00:40:03,305
Then, Miss A-Luo,

727
00:40:03,825 --> 00:40:05,465
-do you know of a kind of...
-Miss A-Luo.

728
00:40:06,385 --> 00:40:07,425
I see your courtyard

729
00:40:07,505 --> 00:40:10,065
is full of flowers.
What are they used for?

730
00:40:10,145 --> 00:40:12,425
Tomorrow is our valley's Flower Festival.

731
00:40:12,505 --> 00:40:14,705
I'm preparing flower cakes
for the celebration.

732
00:40:15,265 --> 00:40:16,345
Make yourselves comfortable.

733
00:40:16,425 --> 00:40:17,505
Have a good chat.

734
00:40:17,585 --> 00:40:18,465
If you need anything,

735
00:40:18,545 --> 00:40:19,505
just call me.

736
00:40:27,385 --> 00:40:28,585
Lord Meng.

737
00:40:28,665 --> 00:40:30,745
I was about to ask
where the Fuqing Grass is.

738
00:40:30,825 --> 00:40:32,425
Why did you stop me?

